sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pres as Presenter
    participant HMI
    participant Eng as Simulation engine
    Pres->>HMI: Open Setup tab
    Pres->>HMI: Enter site, upload profile and datasheet
    Pres->>HMI: Set mismatch and sensor noise
    Pres->>HMI: Validate setup
    HMI->>Eng: Check profile, parameters, thresholds
    Eng-->>HMI: Setup OK
    Pres->>HMI: Apply and start
    HMI->>Eng: Start run_001
